cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "uvp6-auv-sample-creation: Python pipeline for UVP6 deployments on autonomous underwater vehicles"
abstract: >-
  Creates the UVPapp sample file of a UVP6 deployed on an autonomous underwater vehicle (AUV): the
  deployment is sectioned into phases (downcasts, upcasts, transects, surface transects, transitions)
  from the vehicle data, one netCDF file is written per phase, the UVP6 images are matched to each
  phase, and the sample file, CTD files and quality checks are written. Developed and tested with the
  Autosub Long Range (ALR).
type: software
